            <div xml:id="d535">

                <pb facs="0561" n="443" sameAs="frus:frus1929v03/pg443"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">411.12/946: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in Mexico</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Morrow</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-08-07T17:00:00-04:00">August 7, 1929—5
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>435. Your 306, August 6, 7 p.m. Paragraph one satisfactory.</p>
                <p>Paragraph two satisfactory.</p>
                <p>Your form letter satisfactory excepting substitute for word “implementing” the
                    words “carrying out”. Submit text thus amended to Estrada.</p>
                <p>Paragraph four satisfactory.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
